Package: pkexport
Title: Clean Raw Clinical PK Data into a Standard Table
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Charlie", "Salow", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "charlessalow@gmail.com"),
    person("Shiva", "", role = "aut"))
Description: Takes raw dose, drug level, and covariate tables and combines them
    into one standard table with time since first dose (TIME) and time after
    the most recent dose (TAD), ready for export to Monolix.
